        "slc_5ad13d75d45e0add5739f2dc332e025818c1e4f1b3ec78ad54f849f89ead0b89"
      ],
      "text": "The tool is invoked as a shell script: piping a prompt to `sh postmortemthis.cmd` runs it across all agents, with `setup` and `doctor` subcommands for configuration and availability checks."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_55f18fecfc63c413d6278f1140f7475275a087c0149e918ca865bf38e83a23be",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "37f38fea5a621e7c06669625f3cc2ee3f0c895ab",
          "git_sha": "3c2b2b8a537d564eb3dbf343c2f822d4e41bfd5a",
          "line_end": 9,
          "line_start": 9,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "softeria/postmortemthis",
          "url": "https://github.com/Softeria/postmortemthis/blob/37f38fea5a621e7c06669625f3cc2ee3f0c895ab/README.md#L9-L9"
        },
        {
          "commit": "37f38fea5a621e7c06669625f3cc2ee3f0c895ab",
          "git_sha": "3c2b2b8a537d564eb3dbf343c2f822d4e41bfd5a",
          "line_end": 20,
          "line_start": 17,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "softeria/postmortemthis",
          "url": "https://github.com/Softeria/postmortemthis/blob/37f38fea5a621e7c06669625f3cc2ee3f0c895ab/README.md#L17-L20"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_1dbfe0b2005fbefdee6633debc2d0a388e8e9c82481005e118000bc51aa11e5c",
        "slc_d4cc99feba8f2726c0a950c59ea2d80e3c2f98e317e0ca56d2e7d2792a0b6490"
      ],
      "text": "It runs one prompt across several coding-agent CLIs (Claude Code, Codex, Antigravity, Qwen, Vibe, Grok) in parallel, each reading the current diff."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_2a3accaea063c5b2034e3021746828036e5691cc3cbabd138bceba84756b850b",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "tools-permissions",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "37f38fea5a621e7c06669625f3cc2ee3f0c895ab",
          "git_sha": "3c2b2b8a537d564eb3dbf343c2f822d4e41bfd5a",
          "line_end": 9,
          "line_start": 9,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "softeria/postmortemthis",
          "url": "https://github.com/Softeria/postmortemthis/blob/37f38fea5a621e7c06669625f3cc2ee3f0c895ab/README.md#L9-L9"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_1dbfe0b2005fbefdee6633debc2d0a388e8e9c82481005e118000bc51aa11e5c"
      ],
      "text": "Read-only operation is enforced by each agent's own CLI, except Antigravity which lacks such a switch and is instead constrained via its plan mode; the user is notified if the tree changes during a run."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_a5af11315f5cad9e7c39df4a5ffeeae36dd11b5bbacfeb0d37cdc34fffeeb863",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "37f38fea5a621e7c06669625f3cc2ee3f0c895ab",
          "git_sha": "3c2b2b8a537d564eb3dbf343c2f822d4e41bfd5a",
          "line_end": 28,
          "line_start": 28,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "softeria/postmortemthis",
          "url": "https://github.com/Softeria/postmortemthis/blob/37f38fea5a621e7c06669625f3cc2ee3f0c895ab/README.md#L28-L28"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_6f37f7dbbab44977c1a380f74490c903c6b23d387a1182ffeb2b808f7e4cd83a"
      ],
      "text": "The tool depends on the user's installed coding-agent CLIs and their logins; for agents without access, OpenRouter is used via OAuth login or an OPENROUTER_API_KEY, with usage billed to the user's account."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_6ce8b38c0e210435c12601f8b2371b8a5b4a9dedfd9d5b0e93d2d447562d3d53",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "37f38fea5a621e7c06669625f3cc2ee3f0c895ab",
          "git_sha": "3c2b2b8a537d564eb3dbf343c2f822d4e41bfd5a",
          "line_end": 30,
          "line_start": 30,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "softeria/postmortemthis",
          "url": "https://github.com/Softeria/postmortemthis/blob/37f38fea5a621e7c06669625f3cc2ee3f0c895ab/README.md#L30-L30"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_8b4a037837b5bb65f953ef5f828bda1e2795078cfce2d92cd87e8e7fb93d0a2e"
      ],
      "text": "Grok is run through an OpenAI-compatible harness against the OpenRouter model x-ai/grok-build-0.1, since Grok's own CLI cannot reach OpenRouter."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_4e7e58d859372c706bfc3c119cc90fdf2f6189973539cc8d87ec101a03a2fc16",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "workflows",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "37f38fea5a621e7c06669625f3cc2ee3f0c895ab",
          "git_sha": "3c2b2b8a537d564eb3dbf343c2f822d4e41bfd5a",
          "line_end": 32,
          "line_start": 32,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "softeria/postmortemthis",
          "url": "https://github.com/Softeria/postmortemthis/blob/37f38fea5a621e7c06669625f3cc2ee3f0c895ab/README.md#L32-L32"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_a14a50a4f4c7b2623326575cc2aea8300ba2a3b956d811efee5a65437283eecf"
      ],
      "text": "A `setup` command probes each agent, lets the user log in, force OpenRouter, or disable an agent, optionally fires a test prompt, and saves the choices for later runs."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_396f0a5dc8223be646839082bd6331e6110ab12fb269d66185e7d18ea6ec0e38",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "skills-patterns",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
