          "git_sha": "3c2b2b8a537d564eb3dbf343c2f822d4e41bfd5a",
          "line_end": 9,
          "line_start": 9,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "softeria/postmortemthis",
          "url": "https://github.com/Softeria/postmortemthis/blob/37f38fea5a621e7c06669625f3cc2ee3f0c895ab/README.md#L9-L9"
        },
        {
          "commit": "37f38fea5a621e7c06669625f3cc2ee3f0c895ab",
          "git_sha": "3c2b2b8a537d564eb3dbf343c2f822d4e41bfd5a",
          "line_end": 24,
          "line_start": 24,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "softeria/postmortemthis",
          "url": "https://github.com/Softeria/postmortemthis/blob/37f38fea5a621e7c06669625f3cc2ee3f0c895ab/README.md#L24-L24"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_1dbfe0b2005fbefdee6633debc2d0a388e8e9c82481005e118000bc51aa11e5c",
        "slc_c69a7c6801cff14dc6c01a697535fdc475fd1a254a35f97c0189b2a4c3f53093"
      ],
      "text": "The design keeps the user inside their own agent, which makes the final call, while the external agents only read the diff; the script is described as the only fixed part of the system."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_ea01a76bb5e758d13ca9c68c8ad398be3e27ce336952d92c21efb7600031f40c",
