          "git_sha": "3c2b2b8a537d564eb3dbf343c2f822d4e41bfd5a",
          "line_end": 11,
          "line_start": 11,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "softeria/postmortemthis",
          "url": "https://github.com/Softeria/postmortemthis/blob/37f38fea5a621e7c06669625f3cc2ee3f0c895ab/README.md#L11-L11"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_378ed7409cc60f4d5b4ebe7722ad5aad85d8246a7ffd58883006f7c3a14c1676"
      ],
      "text": "The product is described as a single small script that installs, updates, and runs all the agents on Windows, macOS, and Linux, with no server or MCP required."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_33d6b7b3148a0696b260f02ed4a3f6387f5f9f2933b90c04950ab5b8956c7a4e",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "limitations",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "37f38fea5a621e7c06669625f3cc2ee3f0c895ab",
          "git_sha": "3c2b2b8a537d564eb3dbf343c2f822d4e41bfd5a",
          "line_end": 9,
          "line_start": 9,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "softeria/postmortemthis",
          "url": "https://github.com/Softeria/postmortemthis/blob/37f38fea5a621e7c06669625f3cc2ee3f0c895ab/README.md#L9-L9"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_1dbfe0b2005fbefdee6633debc2d0a388e8e9c82481005e118000bc51aa11e5c"
      ],
      "text": "Per the README, read-only enforcement is not uniform: Antigravity's CLI has no read-only switch, so it is held to read-only behavior only through its plan mode."
    }
